{"id":12423,"date":"2025-03-12T09:15:25","date_gmt":"2025-03-12T09:15:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12423"},"modified":"2025-03-12T09:18:36","modified_gmt":"2025-03-12T09:18:36","slug":"dokonaly-dousek-jak-zajistit-nejvyssi-kvalitu-napoju-pomoci-ft-ir-spektroskopie","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/dokonaly-dousek-jak-zajistit-nejvyssi-kvalitu-napoju-pomoci-ft-ir-spektroskopie\/","title":{"rendered":"Dokonal\u00fd dou\u0161ek: Jak zajistit nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00ed kvalitu n\u00e1poj\u016f pomoc\u00ed FT-IR spektroskopie?"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"475\">V potravin\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu je kvalita surovin z\u00e1sadn\u00ed. P\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b je proto z\u00e1sadn\u00ed testovat <strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"283\">v\u0161e od vstupn\u00edch surovin a\u017e po hotov\u00e9 n\u00e1poje<\/strong>, aby v\u00fdsledn\u00e9 produkty byly bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 a chutn\u00e9. Jedn\u00edm z kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00fdch faktor\u016f ovliv\u0148uj\u00edc\u00edch v\u00fdslednou kvalitu je <strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"436\">\u010distota oxidu uhli\u010dit\u00e9ho (CO\u2082)<\/strong>, kter\u00fd se pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 pro sycen\u00ed n\u00e1poj\u016f.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"516\"><strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"514\">Pro\u010d je d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e1 \u010distota CO\u2082?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"748\">Oxid uhli\u010dit\u00fd pou\u017e\u00edvan\u00fd v n\u00e1poj\u00edch mus\u00ed spl\u0148ovat p\u0159\u00edsn\u00e9 normy: <strong data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"609\">minim\u00e1ln\u011b 99,9% \u010distotu<\/strong>. I stopov\u00e9ho mno\u017estv\u00ed ne\u010distot, jako jsou aromatick\u00e9 uhlovod\u00edky, si mohou spot\u0159ebitel\u00e9 v\u0161imnout jako <strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"745\">ne\u017e\u00e1douc\u00edho pachu nebo zm\u011bny chuti<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"981\">Pokud se ne\u010distoty v CO\u2082 nezachyt\u00ed v\u010das, mohou se projevit a\u017e v hotov\u00e9m n\u00e1poji na prodejn\u00edch pultech. Reklamace z\u00e1kazn\u00edk\u016f pak zp\u011btn\u011b odhaluj\u00ed probl\u00e9m, kter\u00e9mu by se dalo p\u0159edej\u00edt. Proto je <strong data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"978\">p\u0159esn\u00e1 a v\u010dasn\u00e1 anal\u00fdza CO\u2082 kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e1<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1030\"><strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1028\">Jak kontroluje kvalitu CO\u2082 <\/strong><strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1028\">Coca-Cola<\/strong><strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1028\">?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1299\">D\u0159\u00edve se vzorky CO\u2082 odeb\u00edraly ru\u010dn\u011b, odn\u00e1\u0161ely do laborato\u0159e a podrobovaly test\u016fm, kter\u00e9 mohly trvat <strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1144\">a\u017e hodinu<\/strong>. Tento proces zahrnoval pou\u017eit\u00ed <strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1225\">chemik\u00e1li\u00ed a laboratorn\u00edho n\u00e1dob\u00ed<\/strong>, co\u017e nejen zpomalovalo v\u00fdrobu, ale tak\u00e9 zvy\u0161ovalo mo\u017enost lidsk\u00e9 chyby.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1537\">Dnes Coca-Cola Beverages Northeast pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 <strong data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1382\">Thermo Scientific <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/max-bev-co%e2%82%82-purity-monitoring-system\/\">MAX-Bev System<\/a><\/strong>, kter\u00fd vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 <strong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1420\">FT-IR spektroskopii<\/strong> k <strong data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1534\">rychl\u00e9 a p\u0159esn\u00e9 anal\u00fdze CO\u2082 p\u0159\u00edmo p\u0159i p\u0159\u00edjmu dod\u00e1vky<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1591\"><strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1589\">V\u00fdhody FTIR spektroskopie v MAX-Bev System<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"2236\">\u2714 <strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1620\">M\u011b\u0159en\u00ed v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase:<\/strong> Anal\u00fdza prob\u00edh\u00e1 <strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1669\">p\u0159ibli\u017en\u011b dev\u011bt minut<\/strong>, co\u017e umo\u017e\u0148uje okam\u017eitou kontrolu kvality.<br data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1714\" \/>\u2714 <strong data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1747\">Detekce stopov\u00fdch ne\u010distot:<\/strong> FT-IR spektroskopie dok\u00e1\u017ee <strong data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1821\">identifikovat ne\u010distoty na \u00farovni ppm i ppb<\/strong> (\u010d\u00e1stic na milion\/miliardu), nap\u0159\u00edklad aromatick\u00e9 uhlovod\u00edky v koncentraci <strong data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1909\">0,02 ppm<\/strong>.<br data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1913\" \/>\u2714 <strong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1961\">Automatizace a minimalizace lidsk\u00fdch chyb:<\/strong> Syst\u00e9m automaticky vyhodnocuje \u010distotu CO\u2082 a poskytuje <strong data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2056\">jednoduch\u00fd v\u00fdstup \u201epro\u0161lo\/nepro\u0161lo\u201c<\/strong>, co\u017e sni\u017euje riziko chybn\u00e9ho rozhodnut\u00ed.<br data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2100\" \/>\u2714 <strong data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2124\">Zrychlen\u00ed procesu:<\/strong> Laboratorn\u00ed technici nemus\u00ed manipulovat se vzorky, \u010dekat na v\u00fdsledky ani se vracet k dodavatel\u016fm s reklamac\u00ed.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_11403\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-11403\" style=\"width: 562px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-11403 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/04\/20d76b81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"562\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/04\/20d76b81.png 562w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2023\/04\/20d76b81-300x266.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 562px) 100vw, 562px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-11403\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/max-bev-co%e2%82%82-purity-monitoring-system\/\">MAX-Bev<\/a>: spolehliv\u00fd syst\u00e9m poskytuj\u00edc\u00ed rychl\u00e9 a p\u0159esn\u00e9 v\u00fdsledky<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h3 data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2293\"><strong data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2291\">Jak prob\u00edh\u00e1 testov\u00e1n\u00ed CO\u2082 p\u0159i p\u0159\u00edjmu dod\u00e1vky?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2724\">\n<li data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2372\">Po p\u0159\u00edjezdu cisterny <strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2369\">laboratorn\u00ed technik ov\u011b\u0159\u00ed t\u011bsn\u011bn\u00ed a dokumentaci<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2445\">Vzorek CO\u2082 se <strong data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2425\">automaticky odebere a analyzuje<\/strong> pomoc\u00ed spektrometru MAX-Bev System.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2610\"><strong data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2493\">V\u00fdsledky se zobraz\u00ed b\u011bhem n\u011bkolika minut<\/strong>. Pokud CO\u2082 spl\u0148uje normy Coca-Coly a ISBT (International Society of Beverage Technologists), je dod\u00e1vka schv\u00e1lena.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2724\"><strong data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2656\">Pokud CO\u2082 nespl\u0148uje po\u017eadovan\u00e9 hodnoty<\/strong>, dod\u00e1vka se odm\u00edtne, \u010d\u00edm\u017e se zabr\u00e1n\u00ed mo\u017en\u00e9mu znehodnocen\u00ed n\u00e1poj\u016f.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3114\"><strong data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3112\">V\u00fdznam FT-IR spektroskopie v potravin\u00e1\u0159stv\u00ed<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3356\">Pou\u017eit\u00ed FT-IR spektroskopie umo\u017e\u0148uje detekovat ne\u010distoty <strong data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3233\">na \u00farovni, kter\u00e1 by jin\u00fdmi metodami byla obt\u00ed\u017en\u011b m\u011b\u0159iteln\u00e1<\/strong>. Pro v\u00fdrobce n\u00e1poj\u016f a potravin je to kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00fd n\u00e1stroj k <strong data-start=\"3298\" data-end=\"3353\">zaji\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed konzistentn\u00ed chuti a bezpe\u010dnosti produkt\u016f<\/strong>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>V potravin\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu je kvalita surovin z\u00e1sadn\u00ed. P\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b je proto z\u00e1sadn\u00ed testovat v\u0161e od vstupn\u00edch surovin a\u017e po hotov\u00e9 n\u00e1poje, aby v\u00fdsledn\u00e9 produkty byly bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 a chutn\u00e9. Jedn\u00edm z kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00fdch faktor\u016f ovliv\u0148uj\u00edc\u00edch v\u00fdslednou kvalitu je \u010distota oxidu uhli\u010dit\u00e9ho (CO\u2082), kter\u00fd se pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 pro sycen\u00ed n\u00e1poj\u016f. Pro\u010d je d\u016fle\u017eit\u00e1 \u010distota CO\u2082? Oxid uhli\u010dit\u00fd pou\u017e\u00edvan\u00fd v [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":12424,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[133,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12423","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-133","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Dokonal\u00fd dou\u0161ek: Jak zajistit nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00ed kvalitu n\u00e1poj\u016f pomoc\u00ed FT-IR spektroskopie? - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/dokonaly-dousek-jak-zajistit-nejvyssi-kvalitu-napoju-pomoci-ft-ir-spektroskopie\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"cs_CZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Dokonal\u00fd dou\u0161ek: Jak zajistit nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00ed kvalitu n\u00e1poj\u016